# {{ siteName }} (`{{ siteName }}`)

Static marketing site for {{ siteName }}, {{ themeName }}, built with Astro on the shared event kit (`@query/event-kit`). No database. Made by `pnpm turbo gen hacklytics`.

**How a new edition works:** [docs/sites/new-edition.md](../../docs/sites/new-edition.md)

Two files make the edition. Everything else comes from the kit.

| File | What to put in it |
| --- | --- |
| `src/event.config.ts` | The dates, links and every line of page copy. Search for `TODO`. [Field reference](../../docs/sites/event-kit.md#eventconfig) |
| `src/styles/globals.css` | The palette and the two font families. `--ground` must equal `theme.ground` in the config |

Also replace `public{{ shareImage }}`, the 1200 by 630 share image, which is copied from {{ latestDir }}, and give `src/pages/index.astro` a hero of its own.{{#if copyTheme}} The fonts in `public/fonts` and `src/styles/fonts.generated.css` are copied from {{ latestDir }} too; `{{ latestDir }}/scripts/subset-fonts.py` made them.{{/if}}

```bash
pnpm --filter {{ siteName }} dev        # astro dev
pnpm --filter {{ siteName }} build      # static files -> out/
pnpm --filter {{ siteName }} preview    # serve out/
pnpm --filter {{ siteName }} typecheck  # tsc --noEmit
```
